  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL) services for the seven-year Territorios Forestales Sosteinbles (TEFOS) programme in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring Evaluation and Learning of the TEFOS programme (formerly &#xE2;&#x20AC;&#x153;ForTREES For People) which aims to stabilise the deforestation frontier in the areas of Colombia most acutely threatened by deforestation and affected by conflict, by improving land systems and usage rights, building capacity to effectively tackle environmental crime, and promoting sustainable forest livelihoods and enterprises. (https://devtracker.fcdo.gov.uk/projects/GB-GOV-13-ICF-0039-ForTREES/summary)</narrative>
  </description>
